  <RulePackDef>
    <defName>Nexus_News_Truth</defName>
    <include>
      <li>GlobalUtility</li>
      <li>ArtDescriptionUtility_Global</li>
    </include>
    <rulePack>
      <rulesStrings>
        <li>root->[TruthHeader]: [Template_Glitch]</li>
        <li>root->[TruthHeader]: [Template_Observer]</li>
        <li>root->[TruthHeader]: [Template_Philosophy]</li>

        <li>Template_Glitch->警告：[Sector] 的 [Glitch_Object] 发生了 [Glitch_Type]。请勿 [Action_Avoid]，等待补丁修复。</li>
        <li>Template_Glitch->如果您发现天空变成了 [Color]，或者是 [Animal] 开始倒着走路，那只是 [Reason_Tech]。请假装没看见。</li>
